# Subproject skills

This project splits skills by folder. **Read that side's `SKILL.md` before writing or changing code.**

| Folder | Skill to read |
|--------|----------------|
| `design/**`, `db/schema/**` | `.cursor/skills/design/SKILL.md` |
| `frontend/**` | `.cursor/skills/frontend/SKILL.md` |
| `backend/**`, `infrastructure/**` | `.cursor/skills/backend/SKILL.md` |
| `document/postman/**` or API test / Postman work | `.cursor/skills/tester/SKILL.md` |

Notes:

- `db/schema/` = real DB schema (SQL) — the design skill reads it for mock data shape; the backend skill turns it into real migrations
- Any change to system behavior → follow `.cursor/rules/document.mdc` and update `document/` (checklist / knowledge / postman) in the same turn
- Phase checklists live under `document/checklist/<area>/` where `<area>` is `design`, `frontend`, `backend`, or `infrastructure`
- Cross-cutting work → read every related skill
- Invoke directly with `/design`, `/frontend`, `/backend`, `/tester`
